The method (ingest, cluster, arc, grounded takes, per-questioner loopbacks with honest roles, verified receipt) follows Uncommon Ground by Audrey Tang and collaborators (https://github.com/audreyt/uncommon-ground, CC0 1.0). This project reimplements it for Cloudflare Workers; the briefs are public domain and this code is MIT.
